cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ExcaScene, please cite the paper and the versions of the code and data you used."
type: software
title: "ExcaScene: decision-centric evaluation of excavator perception under sensor faults"
abstract: >-
  ExcaScene pairs articulated camera-LiDAR simulations of an excavator with
  controlled sensor faults and a fixed digging-point selector, so that
  perception models are evaluated by decision regret and unsafe selections as
  well as by map error. The release contains the scene generator, sensor and
  fault models, two perception architectures, camera-health monitors,
  classical and fixed reference policies, the evaluator and the analysis code.
